lment/dms.mdx","Configura y opera el DMS","Define registro, autenticación por operación, emisión, renovación y confianza distribuida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms",{"_76":255},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/dms.mdx",{"_51":257,"_58":69,"_53":258,"_63":259,"_72":-7,"_12":260,"_74":261},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_76":262},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_51":264,"_58":69,"_53":265,"_63":266,"_72":-7,"_12":267,"_74":268},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_76":269},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_51":271,"_58":69,"_53":272,"_63":273,"_72":-7,"_12":274,"_74":275},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_76":276},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_51":278,"_58":69,"_53":279,"_63":280,"_72":-7,"_12":281,"_74":282},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-74/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_76":283},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_51":285,"_58":69,"_53":286,"_63":287,"_72":-7,"_12":288,"_74":289},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de L